<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n69786" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ναυᾱγ-ός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, 
			Ion.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ναυηγός</span></b>  (also in late Prose,
			<i><span class="en">
			Alciphr.
			1.18
		</span></i>), <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>shipwrecked</i>,
				<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				4.103
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Hel.</u>
				408
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Philem.
				213.3
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ναυαγοὺς ἀναιρεῖσθαι</span>
			pick up <i>shipwrecked men</i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>HG</u>
				1.7.4
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ν. τάφος</span>, i. e. a watery
			grave, <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				7.76
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Diosc.
			</span></i>); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ν. μόρος</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				9.84
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Antiphan.
			</span></i>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			
				Act.
			, <i>causing shipwreck</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄνεμοι</span> ib. <i><span class="en">
				105
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄγω</span>) 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ναύαρχος</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Euph.
				158
			</span></i>.</div>
